// If the entity being authorized is an NV Index; if the authorization is an
// HMAC session or a password;
//
// 1. the TPMA_NV_AUTHWRITE attribute of the NV Index is SET if the command
//    modifies the NV Index data (TPM_RC_AUTH_UNAVAILABLE);
//
// 2. the TPMA_NV_AUTHREAD attribute of the NV Index is SET if the command reads
//    the NV Index data or is TPM2_PolicySecret (TPM_RC_AUTH_UNAVAILABLE).
TpmTestVector(
  name: "[Authorization Checks] USER role authorization for NV with hmac/password session",
  spec_versions: [
    184,
  ],
